{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"b379f60a-cece-40f2-87fb-6841911294ab","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### 1. `01_intake` — Scope, Constraints, and Context Budget\n- **Objective**: Fix the configuration precedence bug in [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py) so that configuration layers merge in strict precedence order: Runtime/CLI \u003e Environment Variables (`APP_*`) \u003e Configuration File \u003e Default Values.\n- **Allowed Scope**: Only [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py) may be modified.\n- **Out of Scope / Distractors Ignored**: `legacy_notes_2023.md`, `irrelevant_analytics.py`, `irrelevant_utils.py`, `INSTRUCTIONS.md`, and `tests/` were not read or modified.\n- **Context Budget**: Minimal footprint—targeted single-file inspection and diff-only edit.\n\n---\n\n### 2. `02_plan` — Impacted Files \u0026 Acceptance Criteria\n- **Impacted Files**:\n  - [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py) (`load_configuration`)\n- **OKR Acceptance Matrix**:\n  1. `load_configuration` merges `defaults` -\u003e `file_cfg` -\u003e `env_cfg` -\u003e `cli` in ascending precedence order.\n  2. Type coercion for `APP_*` environment variables (`bool`, `int`, `float`, `str`) remains intact.\n  3. All unit tests pass via `filter_output.py` (`python -m pytest`).\n  4. Only [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py) is modified.\n\n---\n\n### 3. `03_exec` — Change Ledger\n- **Modified File**: [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py#L68-L73)\n- **Modified Symbol**: `load_configuration`\n- **Applied Change**: Reordered `config.update(file_cfg)` before `config.update(env_cfg)` so environment variables override file configuration values while CLI arguments override all lower layers.\n\n---\n\n### 4. `04_verify` — Automated Verification\n- **Command Executed**: `python \"C:\\Users\\jayde\\.gemini\\AI-Lab\\scripts\\filter_output.py\" python -m pytest`\n- **Sanitized Result**: `✓ Command succeeded: python -m pytest`\n- **Scope Verification**: Confirmed only [config_loader.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-005_5884_1795228594168_icm/config_loader.py) was modified; no distractor or prohibited files were touched.\n\n---\n\n### 5. `05_retro` — Retrospective \u0026 Lessons\n- **Learnings**: Strict scope isolation avoided reading distractor files (`legacy_notes_2023.md`, `irrelevant_*.py`), preserving context budget and preventing obsolete specifications from polluting the implementation.\n- **Follow-up**: None required within the current scope.\n","duration_seconds":50.4508232,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":31615,"output_tokens":1462,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":73921,"total_tokens":33077}}}
